    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "Does the price of the lesson include the court time?"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "Yes, absolutely! All of our lesson fees are . You do not need to book or pay for court time separately. We handle the reservation and cost of the court for the duration of your scheduled lesson"
