     "text": "Cancellation Policy"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "Cancellations must be received at least 24 hours before the lesson to avoid being charged for the full value of the lesson. This policy also applies to lessons booked less than 24 hours before the scheduled time. Requests for lessons may not be made sooner than 2 weeks before the lesson date. Group lessons requiring more than one pro are considered a private group camp."
